@inject IOptions<StoreSettings> StoreOptions
@{
    var store = StoreOptions.Value;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms & conditions";
    ViewData["Description"] = $"The terms that apply when you shop at {store.Name}: orders, prices, payment, delivery, returns and accounts.";
    ViewData["HelpSection"] = "Terms";
}

<div class="container-hs">
    <nav class="breadcrumb-bar" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="breadcrumb">
            <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a asp-action="Index">Home</a></li>
            <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Terms &amp; conditions</li>
        </ol>
    </nav>
    <div class="page-head"><h1>Terms &amp; conditions</h1></div>
    <div class="help-layout">
        <partial name="_HelpNav" />
        <article class="prose">
            <p class="lead-muted">These terms apply when you use this website and buy from @store.Name. By placing an order you agree to them.</p>

            <h2>1. Your account</h2>
            <p>You need an account to place an order. Keep your password safe; you're responsible for activity on your account. Please give accurate details so we can deliver your order.</p>

            <h2>2. Orders</h2>
            <p>When you place an order we send a confirmation email with your order number. All orders depend on stock being available. If we can't fulfil an order, for example because of a stock or pricing error, we'll cancel it and let you know — you won't have paid anything.</p>

            <h2>3. Prices and payment</h2>
            <p>Prices are in euros (@store.Currency) and include VAT. Your total, including any discount and delivery cost, is calculated at checkout and shown before you confirm. @if (PaymentProviders.ActiveProvider != null)
            {
                <text>You can pay by <strong>debit or credit card</strong> on our payment provider's secure page@(PaymentProviders.CashOnDeliveryEnabled ? Html.Raw(", or <strong>cash on delivery</strong>") : Html.Raw("")).
                A card order is only confirmed once the payment provider confirms the payment; if the payment isn't completed within the time shown at checkout, the order is cancelled automatically and nothing is charged.</text>
            }
            else
            {
                <text>Orders are paid <strong>cash on delivery</strong>: you pay when you receive your items. We don't accept online card payments at this time.</text>
            }</p>

            <h2>4. Discount codes</h2>
            <p>Each code has its own conditions (such as a minimum order amount, expiry date or limited number of uses), which are checked when you apply it and again at checkout. Codes can't be exchanged for cash.</p>

            <h2>5. Delivery</h2>
            <p>We deliver to Kosovo, Albania, North Macedonia and Montenegro, or you can collect from our store. Delivery options, costs and estimated times are listed on the <a asp-action="Shipping">shipping page</a>. Estimated times aren't guaranteed.</p>

            <h2>6. Cancellations and returns</h2>
            <p>You can cancel an order from your account until it ships. Unused items can be returned within @store.ReturnDays days of delivery, as described on the <a asp-action="Returns">returns page</a>. This doesn't affect your statutory rights for faulty goods.</p>

            <h2>7. Reviews and messages</h2>
            <p>Reviews must be honest, about the product, and free of offensive or personal content. We may decline or remove reviews that don't meet these rules.</p>

            <h2>8. Liability</h2>
            <p>Outdoor activities carry risk. Follow the manufacturer's instructions for all equipment and check that gear suits your activity and conditions. Nothing in these terms limits liability that can't be limited by law.</p>

            <h2>9. Contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about these terms? <a asp-action="Contact">Contact us</a> or email <a href="mailto:@store.SupportEmail">@store.SupportEmail</a>.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</div>
